78
00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:10.155
A Level Two Shadowfang Hound—a beast engineered for ambushing civilian

79
00:04:10.155 --> 00:04:12.990
scavengers.

80
00:04:12.990 --> 00:04:16.966
With a guttural snarl, the alpha lunged across twenty paces,

81
00:04:16.966 --> 00:04:20.942
