82
00:04:20.942 --> 00:04:24.261
Ordinary instincts would have screamed to dodge.

83
00:04:24.261 --> 00:04:26.958
But Ethan stood completely still, his eyes tracking the creature's

84
00:04:26.958 --> 00:04:29.655
trajectory.

85
00:04:29.655 --> 00:04:33.527
