91
00:04:44.823 --> 00:04:47.796
The beast’s upper jaw shattered on contact.

92
00:04:47.796 --> 00:04:50.977
Its fangs splintered into fragments, scattering across the wet flags

93
00:04:50.977 --> 00:04:54.158
like cracked porcelain.

94
00:04:54.158 --> 00:04:58.191
To a creature possessing a combined physical strength of barely

95
00:04:58.191 --> 00:05:02.224
fifteen points, clamping down on Ethan’s two-hundred Constitution was equivalent

96
00:05:02.224 --> 00:05:06.257
to biting an industrial anvil.

97
00:05:06.257 --> 00:05:08.712
Ethan felt nothing more than a dull kinetic vibration against

98
00:05:08.712 --> 00:05:11.167
