99
00:05:11.167 --> 00:05:12.367
Zero penetration.

100
00:05:12.367 --> 00:05:13.567
Zero blood.

101
00:05:13.567 --> 00:05:16.679
Stepping into the pocket, Ethan drove a casual right palm

102
00:05:16.679 --> 00:05:19.791
into the creature's chest plate.

103
00:05:19.791 --> 00:05:23.801
Direct Kinetic Impact: One Hundred Percent Force Transfer.

104
00:05:23.801 --> 00:05:27.650
The impact shockwave blew out the back of the beast’s

105
00:05:27.650 --> 00:05:31.499
ribcage, sending the carcass hurtling twenty metres down the tunnel

106
00:05:31.499 --> 00:05:35.348
