107
00:05:35.348 --> 00:05:36.662
Target Neutralised.

108
00:05:36.662 --> 00:05:38.736
Experience Acquired: +250 EXP.

109
00:05:38.736 --> 00:05:40.257
Progress: 250 / 5,000.

110
00:05:41.976 --> 00:05:44.996
Within the remains of the alpha hound lay an unformed

111
00:05:44.996 --> 00:05:48.016
