112
00:05:48.016 --> 00:05:51.703
Skill Manual Detected: Kinetic Resonance (Passive Tier 1).

113
00:05:51.703 --> 00:05:52.911
Absorb Neural Data?

114
00:05:52.911 --> 00:05:55.644
Ethan pressed his palm against the crystal.

115
00:05:55.644 --> 00:05:58.462
The orb dissolved into a sudden cascade of electrical telemetry,

116
00:05:58.462 --> 00:06:01.280
surging through his optic nerves and slamming into his motor

117
00:06:01.280 --> 00:06:04.098
cortex.

118
00:06:04.098 --> 00:06:06.705
This was not the painless, cartoonish mastery promised in low-grade

119
00:06:06.705 --> 00:06:09.312
