120
00:06:09.312 --> 00:06:14.048
Ethan gritted his teeth as his brain violently integrated ten

121
00:06:14.048 --> 00:06:18.784
thousand repetitions of rotational footwork, impact mitigation, and kinetic dispersion.

122
00:06:18.784 --> 00:06:21.327
A thin bead of sweat traced his jawline.

123
00:06:21.327 --> 00:06:24.951
His muscular fibres twitched in involuntary spasms as his nervous

124
00:06:24.951 --> 00:06:28.575
system recalibrated to the foreign motor memory.

125
00:06:28.575 --> 00:06:30.228
