127
00:06:32.071 --> 00:06:35.186
Every punch he threw was no longer just raw mass.

128
00:06:35.186 --> 00:06:39.000
Kinetic Resonance transformed his natural bodily durability into an offensive

129
00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:42.814
weapon: whenever an opponent struck his flesh, the dissipated kinetic

130
00:06:42.814 --> 00:06:46.628
