137
00:07:08.439 --> 00:07:11.246
Ethan tilted his head two inches to the left.

138
00:07:11.246 --> 00:07:14.895
A hardened steel crossbow bolt hissed past his ear, embedding

139
00:07:14.895 --> 00:07:18.544
