in the lower catacombs.

143
00:07:29.146 --> 00:07:32.680
Their leader, a scarred veteran named Grigor, wielded a pneumatically

144
00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:36.214
powered siege hammer, flanked by riflemen holding the high ground

