154
00:08:11.206 --> 00:08:14.489
Ethan did not attempt a reckless open-field charge.

155
00:08:14.489 --> 00:08:18.062
Instead, he snapped backward on his heels, retreating six metres

156
00:08:18.062 --> 00:08:21.635
