157
00:08:21.635 --> 00:08:25.369
In a three-metre wide corridor, fifteen men meant nothing.

158
00:08:25.369 --> 00:08:28.674
Their numerical advantage collapsed into a bottleneck where only two

159
00:08:28.674 --> 00:08:31.979
