194
00:10:09.481 --> 00:10:13.937
Ethan discharged the kinetic energy stored from the hammer's impact.

195
00:10:13.937 --> 00:10:15.837
Kinetic Resonance Discharged.

196
00:10:15.837 --> 00:10:18.830
A focused shockwave erupted from Ethan's palm, tearing through the

197
00:10:18.830 --> 00:10:21.823
