203
00:10:35.169 --> 00:10:38.708
Survival in Sector Nine was about efficiency, not ego.

204
00:10:44.520 --> 00:10:47.046
The violence in the conduit had awakened the true master

205
00:10:47.046 --> 00:10:49.572
