213
00:11:14.963 --> 00:11:16.416
Ethan met it head-on.

214
00:11:16.416 --> 00:11:19.530
Evading the crushing primary swing with the footwork etched into

215
00:11:19.530 --> 00:11:22.644
his motor cortex, Ethan closed the distance in a blur

216
00:11:22.644 --> 00:11:25.758
of acceleration.

217
00:11:25.758 --> 00:11:30.002
Channelling the full rotational force of his two-hundred Constitution, he

218
00:11:30.002 --> 00:11:34.246
drove a single straight punch into the glowing violet mana

219
00:11:34.246 --> 00:11:38.490
core resting at the centre of the creature’s chest.

220
00:11:38.490 --> 00:11:39.690
SHATTER.

221
00:11:39.690 --> 00:11:43.772
The mineralized core exploded into brilliant violet shards.

222
00:11:43.772 --> 00:11:47.139
The massive stone colossus froze mid-stride, hairline fractures racing across

223
00:11:47.139 --> 00:11:50.506
