228
00:11:59.501 --> 00:12:01.300
Vessel Saturation Reached.

229
00:12:01.300 --> 00:12:05.175
Level 1 Bottleneck Surpassed: Host Advanced to Level 10.

230
00:12:07.824 --> 00:12:11.037
Within the dust of the fallen behemoth lay its pristine

231
00:12:11.037 --> 00:12:14.250
