242
00:12:38.291 --> 00:12:41.458
Thirty minutes later, inside the smoke-filled backrooms of the Red

243
00:12:41.458 --> 00:12:44.625
Raven Auction House, the chief appraiser dropped his jeweller's loupe,

244
00:12:44.625 --> 00:12:47.792
